concept:criminal-code-amendment-war-crimes-act-2016-sec-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Schedules"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3 ;
    values:originalText "Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.  Amendments relating to war crimes  Schedule 1 Members of organised armed groups  Part 1  No. 97, 2016 Criminal Code Amendment (War Crimes) Act 2016" ;
    skos:definition "Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.  Amendments relating to war crimes  Schedule 1 Members of organised armed groups  Part 1  No. 97, 2016 Criminal Code Amendment (War Crimes) Act 2016"@en ;
